On Wed, Nov 05, 2003 at 06:11:32PM -0000, Mr Ekted wrote:
> Is there an online site with all the official details of words,
> meanings, and usage? 

Heh.  The short answer is "Not Yet".

> For example:
> 
> When do I use bacru <-> cusku?

bacru when you are making a noise, cusku when you are communicating
information.

> How much latitude do I have with the x3 of viska? Can I say "mi pu
> viska le mlatu le bumru" meaning "I saw the cat through/in the
> fog"?

The x3 should probably be an event or fact (nu or du'u), but "tu'a le
bumru" is fine.

